          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="honest-take">
    <p class="honest-take__label">Two competitive gates, not one</p>
    <p>
      BBA and BMS admission is not competitive for most students. A genuinely strong MBA seat is a separate, much harder gate through CAT or an equivalent exam. CA, CS, and CMA each run through multiple sequential exam levels with real attrition at every stage, not one qualifying test.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--teal">
    <p>
      <strong>Scalable-ownership path:</strong> a qualified CA, CS, or CMA who builds an own practice controls pricing, client selection, and whether to hire junior staff, which is a genuinely different income curve than staying an employee at a firm.
    </p>
  </div>

